 *** Data units                                      ***
          =Aquifer Hydraulic conductivity   unit in m/s (or m2)
          =Flow (Discharge, Yield)        unit in m3/s (in Kg/s for Gas flow)
          =Hydraulic Head, Elevation, Pressure   unit in meter
          =Confined Storage Coefficient unit in [-] or [m-1]
          =Specific yield               unit in [-] ['%' when in %]
          =Hydroclimatic (Rainfall, PET, Infiltration, Recharge) Height unit in mm
          =Excess Irrigation Height unit in mm
          =Duration unit for hydroclimatic data (second, minute, hour, day, week, decade, month, year)
          =Time unit (for model time steps) (second, minute, hour, day, week, decade, month, year)
          =Grid horizontal coordinate unit in m
         0=Uniform Vertical Anisotropy coefficient Kv/Kh for Hydraulic conductivity
         0=Uniform Horizontal Anisotropy coefficient Kx/Ky for Hydraulic conductivity
          =Input Confined Storage Coeff. (0=Hydrogeol. ; 1=Specific ; 2=Compressibility)
          =Salinity unit [Fresh Water = 0] in kg/m3
          =Concentration unit                  in kg/m3
          =Porosity and Water content unit [dimensionless] ['%' when in %]
          =Water volume (or storage) unit in m3
          =Mass unit in kg
          =Type of permeab: [0=Def=Hydraulic conductivity  ;  1=Intrinsic Permeability]
          =Volume unit for 'geochemical concentration' [Def=0 => per Liter = 1e-3]
          =Type of input Mass and Heat Flow: (Def=per Cell ; 'm2'=per m2 of area)
          =Input form of mineral concentration [Def=0 => mol/m3 of soil ; 1='%Vol' => % Volume]
          =River and Lake Flow unit (Def = General 'Flow and Yield' unit)
          =Gas pressure unit in m of water (Def = hydraulic head and elevation unit)
          =Saline Mass unit in kg
